  m_Name: FoxThanks
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_SpeakerName: Fox
  m_Lines:
  - It's you! I finally found you. I never forgot how you helped me.
  - Now it is my turn. Whenever you need help, you can count on me.
  - Thank you for bringing us together. My search is over!
